# E §6.3 a partly fulfilled line: "an instance of an uncertain kind whose observations sum to less than its amount:
# the amount difference (observed - model), the remainder and a question: when does the rest arrive, or is it
# written off?".  The reality of E6_3_residuals, February only, with a friend's promised repayment of 2 000.00 PLN
# (an uncertain kind, L §5.14) on 2026-02-15, observed as 1 500.00 PLN on the 16th (an observation of a certain kind
# that fulfils it; an observation of an uncertain kind is LOAD-LEG, L §5.19): difference -500.00, remainder 500.00.
# The balance: 15 900 + 1 500 = 17 400 booked against 17 300 stated, gap -100.00.
=== m.tally
model hh
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source plan "plan"
source bank_2026_02 "bank"
source bank_2026_03 "bank"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind wages: event certain
  leg cash: PLN
kind promises: event uncertain
  leg cash: PLN
kind groceries: transfers
  attr payee: text
input bank: observed
input wage_amt: money PLN
input rent_amt: money PLN
input wage_dom: int
input rent_dom: int
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place landlord: outside lives 1900-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
place unexplained: outside lives 1900-01-01..
place friend: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input repay_day: date

move wage[m in months]: wages
  on day_of(m, wage_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from world to konto amount wage_amt

move rent[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, rent_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from konto to landlord amount rent_amt

move repay: promises
  on repay_day
  at repay_day
  leg cash from friend to konto amount rent_amt

version plan_2026
  cite plan
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  wage_amt = 5 000.00 PLN "umowa"
  rent_amt = 2 000.00 PLN "umowa najmu"
  wage_dom = 10 "umowa"
  rent_dom = 3 "umowa najmu"
  repay_day = 2026-02-15 governs always "obietnica"
  opening[konto] = 10 000.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"

version statement_02
  cite bank_2026_02
  governs 2026-02
  known 2026-03-02
  covers konto
  pad konto from unexplained
  bank[r1] = (on: 2026-02-03, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to landlord amount 2 000.00 PLN, fulfils: rent[2026-02]) "line 1"
  bank[r2] = (on: 2026-02-12, kind: wages, leg cash from world to konto amount 5 300.00 PLN, fulfils: wage[2026-02]) "line 2"
  bank[r3] = (on: 2026-02-20, kind: groceries, leg cash from konto to world amount 400.00 PLN, payee: "BIEDRONKA") "line 3"
  bank[r5] = (on: 2026-02-16, kind: transfers, leg cash from friend to konto amount 1 500.00 PLN, fulfils: repay) "line 5"
  stated[konto] = 17 300.00 PLN at 2026-02-28 end "saldo"

version statement_03
  cite bank_2026_03
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-02
  covers konto
  pad konto from unexplained
  bank[r4] = (on: 2026-03-03, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to landlord amount 2 000.00 PLN, fulfils: rent[2026-03]) "line 4"
  stated[konto] = 13 800.00 PLN at 2026-03-31 end "saldo"

ask partly: residuals konto 2026-02
=== expect
partly: residuals konto 2026-02
  2026-02 move repay: model 2 000.00 PLN, observed 1 500.00 PLN, difference -500.00 PLN
    partly fulfilled repay on 2026-02-15: model 2 000.00 PLN, observed 1 500.00 PLN, difference -500.00 PLN, remainder 500.00 PLN: when does the rest arrive, or is it written off?
  2026-02 unexplained: model 0.00 PLN, observed -400.00 PLN, difference -400.00 PLN
    unexplained bank[r3] on 2026-02-20: observed -400.00 PLN
  2026-02 move wage: model 5 000.00 PLN, observed 5 300.00 PLN, difference 300.00 PLN
    matched wage[2026-02] on 2026-02-10: model 5 000.00 PLN, observed 5 300.00 PLN, difference 300.00 PLN, timing +2 days
  2026-02 balance: model 17 400.00 PLN, observed 17 300.00 PLN, difference -100.00 PLN
    balance konto 2026-02-28 end (padded): booked 17 400.00 PLN, stated 17 300.00 PLN, gap -100.00 PLN
  2026-02 move rent: model -2 000.00 PLN, observed -2 000.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN
    matched rent[2026-02] on 2026-02-03: model -2 000.00 PLN, observed -2 000.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN, timing +0 days
  cut 2026-10-20
